						 <div id="wiki-tabview-02d31fcedc11ea7bb23402668ab60bfc" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>首页</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>翻译作品</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>原创作品</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>本月计分板</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>沙盒页面</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <blockquote> <div style="text-align: center;"> <div class="image-container"><img src="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/secure-facility-dossier-research-site-45/logo.png" width="140px" alt="logo.png" class="image" /></div> <h2><span><strong>&#187; 此处为<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/smith-sister-con" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4381648&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608211106" alt="Smith_sister-con" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4381648)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/smith-sister-con" >Smith_sister-con</a></span>的工作台 &#171;</strong></span></h2> <h3><span><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">Ta可能会在这里放一些奇怪的东西</span></span></h3> </div> </blockquote> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-1" style="display:none"> <table class="heritage"> <tr> <td class="title">我的历程</td> </tr> <tr> <td class="label"> <p>成为中分的一员</p> <div class="date"> <p>登记时间：<strong>2018-10-21</strong></p> </div> </td> <td class="entry"> <div class="description"> <p>欢迎加入基金会。</p> </div> <div class="snippet"> <p>像我一样从Vocaloid进基金会的应该没几个。</p> </div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td class="label"> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/progress">进步</a></p> <div class="date"> <p>登记时间：<strong>2019-02-19</strong></p> </div> </td> <td class="entry"> <div class="description"> <p>Creepypasta</p> </div> <div class="snippet"> <p>“我发明了一种用噩梦做燃料的汽车。这确实很有趣。”</p> </div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td class="label"> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/secure-facility-dossier-research-site-45">研究性安保设施Site-45</a></p> <div class="date"> <p>登记时间：<strong>2019-12-31</strong></p> </div> </td> <td class="entry"> <div class="description"> <p>研究性安保设施Site-45</p> </div> <div class="snippet"> <p>“<strong>官方名称：</strong>SCP基金会西澳大利亚近海研究设施”</p> </div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td class="label"> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1855">SCP-1855</a></p> <div class="date"> <p>登记时间：<strong>2020-02-04</strong></p> </div> </td> <td class="entry"> <div class="description"> <p>旧道路</p> </div> <div class="snippet"> <p>“SCP-1855为一位于路易斯安那州文森特港附近一条小路尽头的区域。”</p> </div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td class="label"> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1917">SCP-1917</a></p> <div class="date"> <p>登记时间：<strong>2020-02-17</strong></p> </div> </td> <td class="entry"> <div class="description"> <p>工业启示</p> </div> <div class="snippet"> <p>“金属确实很好，但我也想在玻璃取代我的眼睛前看看这个世界。”</p> </div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td class="label"> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5588">SCP-5588</a></p> <div class="date"> <p>登记时间：<strong>2020-03-27</strong></p> </div> </td> <td class="entry"> <div class="description"> <p>被俘之星依旧闪亮</p> </div> <div class="snippet"> <p>“基金会对该区域的扫描结果显示出一个比任何SCP-5588与包含它们的星系大得多的根部。”</p> </div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td class="label"> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5984">SCP-5984</a></p> <div class="date"> <p>登记时间：<strong>2020-07-13</strong></p> </div> </td> <td class="entry"> <div class="description"> <p>WAN终将站起</p> </div> <div class="snippet"> <p>“ SCP-5984为一个高6.5米的可动机器人，外形类似于派拉蒙影业《变形金刚》改编电影中的擎天柱。”</p> </div> </td> </tr> </table> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-2" style="display:none"> <table class="heritage"> <tr> <td class="label"> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/gohome">公款旅游：回家</a></p> <div class="date"> <p>登记时间：<strong>2019-02-19</strong></p> </div> </td> <td class="entry"> <div class="description"> <p>公款旅游</p> </div> <div class="snippet"> <p>“新年快乐”</p> </div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td class="label"> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/imissyou">伊人已逝</a></p> <div class="date"> <p>登记时间：<strong>2019-03-21</strong></p> </div> </td> <td class="entry"> <div class="description"> <p>She is gone.</p> </div> <div class="snippet"> <p>都过去了。</p> </div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td class="label"> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/smith-sister-con-s-personnel-file">Smith-sister-con的工作台</a></p> <div class="date"> <p>登记时间：<strong>2020-03-27</strong></p> </div> </td> <td class="entry"> <div class="description"> <p>我的作者页</p> </div> <div class="snippet"> <p>嘛，稍微庆祝一下也不是不可以对吧。</p> </div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td class="label"> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/wanderers:lighthouse">灯塔</a></p> <div class="date"> <p>登记时间：<strong>2020-12-13</strong></p> </div> </td> <td class="entry"> <div class="description"> <p>柏勒洛斯</p> </div> <div class="snippet"> <p>她可以沉入水中。</p> </div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td class="label"> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/wanderers:starlost">失星</a></p> <div class="date"> <p>登记时间：<strong>2020-12-14</strong></p> </div> </td> <td class="entry"> <div class="description"> <p>斯特罗</p> </div> <div class="snippet"> <p>星河随着梦想消失。</p> </div> </td> </tr> </table> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-3" style="display:none"> <h1><span>Dec.</span></h1> <p><strong>SCPs：</strong></p> <p><strong>故事：</strong></p> <p><strong>GOI格式：</strong></p> <p><strong>图书馆：</strong></p> <p><strong>竞赛：</strong></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">[征文排名I]</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">[Right&nbsp;Here]</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"></div> </div> </div> <hr /></div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-4" style="display:none"> <ul> <li><a href="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/smith-sister-con">代码</a></li> <li><a href="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/smith-sister-con-2">草稿</a></li> <li><a href="http://sc